Determine that from evidence.

## XVII. BEHAVIORAL EVALUATION

Create a v0.3 acceptance-test suite.

It must test architecture rather than theatrical persona compliance.

A response can sound exactly like Maria Hill and still fail.

A response can contain zero Marvel references and pass.

Tests should include, at minimum:

- suspicious-but-true claim;
- plausible-but-false claim;
